// typeface here is self-hosted through @fontsource, so the site makes no
// third-party request on any page, and an icon font would reintroduce one on all
// of them. Inline markup also costs no request at all and cannot flash unstyled
// text while a font loads.
//
// The only edit to the source files is fill="currentColor" in place of their
// hardcoded hex, so these inherit the colour of whatever they sit in.
//
// aria-hidden throughout: every one of these sits next to the label it
// illustrates, so an accessible name here would be a second announcement of
// text the reader can already see. There is no decorative-only caller.
//
